# AdSense — all three must be set before a single ad unit renders.
# `ADSENSE_LIVE` in src/AdSlot.tsx checks approved + ca-pub- client + numeric
# slot; if any one is missing the component returns null and the site shows no
# ads at all. A DEV-only console line names the missing var.
#
# These are Vite build-time constants, NOT runtime config: changing them here
# does nothing until you re-run `npm run build` and redeploy. See docs/ADSENSE.md.
#
# VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT=ca-pub-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx   # AdSense publisher ID
# VITE_ADSENSE_SLOT=1234567890                  # ad unit ID, digits only
# VITE_ADSENSE_APPROVED=false                   # flip to true only after Google approves the site

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (G-XXXXXXXX)
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXX
